<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Travel World - URK24CS1154 </title>
<style>
*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    font-family:"Trebuchet MS",Verdana,sans-serif;
}
body{
    background:#F4F9F9;
    color:#333;
}
header{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    padding:18px 60px;
    background:linear-gradient(to right,#0A4D68,#088395);
    box-shadow:0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.3);
}
.logo{
    font-size:34px;
    color:white;
    font-weight:bold;
    letter-spacing:2px;
}
nav a{
    text-decoration:none;
    color:white;
    padding:10px 18px;
    margin-left:10px;
    border-radius:30px;
    transition:.4s;
    font-size:18px;
}
nav a:hover{
    background:white;
    color:#0A4D68;
}
.hero{
    height:550px;
    background:
    linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.45),rgba(0,0,0,.45)),
    url("travel.jpg");
    background-size:cover;
    background-position:center;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    color:white;
    text-align:center;
}
.hero h1{
    font-size:65px;
    text-shadow:4px 4px 8px black;
    letter-spacing:2px;
}
.hero p{
    font-size:24px;
    margin:20px;
}
.hero button{
    padding:12px 30px;
    margin:10px;
    border:none;
    border-radius:40px;
    background:#FFB703;
    color:#222;
    font-size:18px;
    font-weight:bold;
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:.4s;
}
.hero button:hover{
    background:#FB8500;
    color:white;
}
.box,.offer,form{
    width:90%;
    margin:30px auto;
    background:white;
    border-radius:20px;
    padding:25px;
    box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.15);
}
.box h2,.offer h2,form h2{
    color:#003049;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}
.gallery{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    gap:25px;
    margin:40px;
}
.gallery img{
    width:300px;
    height:200px;
    border-radius:20px;
    opacity:.85;
    transition:.5s;
    box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.25);
}
.gallery img:hover{
    transform:scale(1.08);
    opacity:1;
}
input{
    width:100%;
    padding:12px;
    margin:10px 0;
    border:1px solid #bbb;
    border-radius:10px;
}
input:focus{
    border:3px solid #088395;
    background:#E8FDFF;
}
input:required{
    background:#FFFBEA;
}
input[type=email]:valid{
    color:green;
}
input[type=email]:invalid{
    color:red;
}
input[type=submit]{
    background:#088395;
    color:white;
    border:none;
    font-size:18px;
    cursor:pointer;
}
input[type=submit]:hover{
    background:#05BFDB;
}
table{
    width:90%;
    margin:30px auto;
    border-collapse:collapse;
    background:white;
    box-shadow:0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.15);
}
th{
    background:#0A4D68;
    color:white;
}
th,td{
    padding:15px;
    border:1px solid #ddd;
}
tr:nth-child(odd){
    background:#F8FCFF;
}
tr:nth-child(even){
    background:#E3F4F4;
}
tr:hover{
    background:#FFE8A3;
}
footer{
    background:#002B5B;
    color:white;
    text-align:center;
    padding:25px;
    font-size:18px;
    margin-top:30px;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<div class="logo">🌍 Travel World</div>
<nav>
<a href="#">Home</a>
<a href="#">Destinations</a>
<a href="#">Gallery</a>
<a href="#">Booking</a>
<a href="#">Contact</a>
</nav>
</header>
<section class="hero">
<h1>Explore The World</h1>
<p>Discover Beautiful Places Around The Globe</p>
<button>Book Now</button>
<button>Explore</button>
</section>
<div class="box">
<h2>Welcome to Travel World</h2>
<p>
Travel World helps you discover amazing beaches, mountains,
historical places and exciting adventures across the world.
Plan your dream vacation with us.
</p>
</div>
<div class="offer">
<h2>Special Holiday Offers</h2>
<p>Get up to 30% discount on your next trip.</p>
</div>
<div class="gallery">
<img src="kerala.jpg">
<img src="simala.jpg">
<img src="maldives.jpg">
</div>
<form>
<h2>Book Your Trip</h2>
<input type="text" placeholder="Your Name" required>
<input type="email" placeholder="Email Address" required>
<input type="text" placeholder="Destination" required>
<input type="date" required>
<input type="submit" value="Book Now">
</form>
<table>
<tr>
<th>Destination</th>
<th>Days</th>
<th>Price</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Kerala</td>
<td>5</td>
<td>6000</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Simala</td>
<td>6</td>
<td>15000</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Maldives</td>
<td>8</td>
<td>30000</td>
</tr>
</table>
<footer>
<h3>Travel World © 2026 | Your Journey Begins Here</h3>
<h4>Web Technology Lab | URK24CS1154 </h4>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
